WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.350
Barnette's conjecture, claimed proved.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.620
A Hamiltonian cycle visits every vertex once.

3
00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.341
Barnette said these graphs always have one.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.996
In a signed sum, bad choices cancel,

5
00:00:10.996 --> 00:00:12.793
and what remains is not zero.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.344
Claimed: every such graph has one.

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.016
Main theorem in Lean.
